{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the mysterious mechanics of manipulation, meticulously crafted through countless experiments to maximize the sensation of levitation.\u00a0This game is dedicated to those seeking a new gaming experience, embodying a deep and thoughtful exploration of what game controls can truly achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike its predecessor, Levitation Simulator 1, which required numerous physical control elements, Levitation Simulator 2 introduces an entirely new control mechanism. In this game, players must navigate their character using just a single key: the spacebar. Your journey to the destination relies solely on this one input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind this unique control system and make the most of extremely limited conditions. Place your fate in the spacebar as you transcend physical and timing-based controls to master all facets of your senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646120?t=1773555923","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646120/65353c4370f04c843fdeb92021b634fcb6c50e5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773555923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646120/5e20f2e0576913d3d2e7455b3b80fa29ccb9c3a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773555923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646120/5e20f2e0576913d3d2e7455b3b80fa29ccb9c3a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773555923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the mysterious mechanics of manipulation, meticulously crafted through countless experiments to maximize the sensation of levitation.\u00a0This game is dedicated to those seeking a new gaming experience, embodying a deep and thoughtful exploration of what game controls can truly achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike its predecessor, Levitation Simulator 1, which required numerous physical control elements, Levitation Simulator 2 introduces an entirely new control mechanism. In this game, players must navigate their character using just a single key: the spacebar. Your journey to the destination relies solely on this one input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind this unique control system and make the most of extremely limited conditions. Place your fate in the spacebar as you transcend physical and timing-based controls to master all facets of your senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["OZNA STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646120/4f643a7227e45dfa4502aeb8fc4ce215a28008a1/header.jpg?t=1773555923","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646120/864433/49f95a106a3eac1f71257fdc7eb9a65f760f235d/1750411558/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744127648","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646120/864433/49f95a106a3eac1f71257fdc7eb9a65f760f235d/1750411558/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744127648","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646120/864433/49f95a106a3eac1f71257fdc7eb9a65f760f235d/1750411558/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744127648","id":257122634,"name":"Levitation Simulator 2 Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122634/1dd157ac06f1125fa20ee0e7ee906f8c9b7bd19a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744127648"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3646120/1470214475/b289b097219cf80ef1d85ee4d652c8929e7c363b/1773555656/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773555922","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.s